Description: Check in the control port with init
 PIE has no launch_msg. auditd -l gets its control port from init with
 bootstrap_check_in. init has set that port as the host's audit control
 port. The kernel sends audit_analytics on the control port, and auditd
 drops it.
Author: The Blueberry Pie OS Authors
Forwarded: not-needed
Last-Update: 2026-11-11

--- a/openbsm/bin/auditd/auditd_darwin.c
